Commit Title:
kernfs/cgroupfs: Fix rename.

Commit State:
committed

Committed At:
2022-04-27T21:17:35+00:00

Commit Message:
Rename was broken for serveral reasons:

- The underlying kernfs.OrderedChildren.Rename had a bug so it could
  never successfully extract OrderedChildren from the dst Inode.

- kernfs.OrderedChildren.Rename didn't check for name collisions on
  the dst.

cgroupfs is the first kernfs-based filesystem to implement rename, so
these code paths weren't exercised.

PiperOrigin-RevId: 444964501

